---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import TraceRail from '../components/TraceRail.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { siteContent } from '../content/siteContent';

const currentPath = Astro.url.pathname;

const contactTrace = [
  {
    id: 'workflow',
    label: 'Bring one workflow',
    note: 'Something slow, costly, inconsistent, or frustrating',
  },
  {
    id: 'map',
    label: 'Decide what software should handle',
    note: 'What stays with people and what can be automated',
  },
  {
    id: 'next-step',
    label: 'Agree the next step',
    note: 'Diagnostic, prototype, or implementation path',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact | Dave Chapman"
  description={siteContent.contact.text}
  canonical={`${siteContent.site.canonical}contact/`}
  ogImage={`${siteContent.site.canonical}social-preview.svg`}
>
  <main id="main-content" class="site page-shell">
    <SiteHeader currentPath={currentPath} />

    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="section-label">Contact</p>
      <h1>{siteContent.contact.title}</h1>
      <p>{siteContent.contact.text}</p>
      <p>
        <a class="button" href={siteContent.contact.href}>{siteContent.contact.button}</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-inner section-duo">
        <div>
          <h2>What happens first?</h2>
          <p>A short conversation about one workflow causing delay, cost, inconsistency, or frustration.</p>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>One workflow where delay, cost, or inconsistency is visible.</li>
            <li>Current tools and handoffs involved.</li>
            <li>What would count as a meaningful improvement.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <TraceRail ariaLabel="Contact conversation flow" steps={contactTrace} />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Common questions</h2>
        <div class="grid two">
          <article class="card">
            <strong>Do I need an AI strategy?</strong>
            <p>No. Bring a business problem. The workflow and the decision-making are the starting point.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <strong>Do I need a technical specification?</strong>
            <p>No. Understanding the workflow is part of the engagement. A specification can come later if the work proves worthwhile.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <strong>What could the outcome be?</strong>
            <p>Typically one of: do nothing, improve the process, use standard automation, build a small prototype, or proceed to implementation.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <strong>What will it cost?</strong>
            <p>The initial conversation is free. Paid work is scoped before starting, and engagements are designed to start small and stay bounded.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <SiteFooter />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
